<title>FRANCE: Suez Lyonnaise selected for Bolivia water contract.</title>
<headline>Suez Lyonnaise selected for Bolivia water contract.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suez Lyonnaise des Eaux said on Friday that a consortium in which it holds 35 percent has been selected to manage the water system of La Paz and its El Alto suburb in Bolivia.</p>
<p>The 30-year contract is expected to generate $20 million in its first year of operation and $1.1 billion in turnover over its lifetime, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The consortium also includes Argentine partners (40 percent), Bolivian partners (20 percent) and engineering firm Connal (5 percent).</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
